If the wedding's not fill tomorrow,
why don't you stay with us tonight?

59
00:04:04,243 --> 00:04:07,204
Oh, I don't think so.
Shelly doesn't like company.

60
00:04:07,371 --> 00:04:11,166
Even as a little boy, he'd send his imaginary
