72
00:04:51,081 --> 00:04:53,917
That's just classic.

73
00:04:54,335 --> 00:04:57,129
I needed a place to fire
ceramic semiconductor substrates...

74
00:04:57,296 --> 00:04:59,339
...for homemade integrated circuits.

75
