112
00:07:14,975 --> 00:07:16,935
The Indian sex book.

113
00:07:17,102 --> 00:07:20,814
In other words, if you wonder, wonder
who wrote the book of love...

114
00:07:20,981 --> 00:07:22,732
...it was us.

115
00:07:24,068 --> 00:07:27,696
-So Sheldon's sister is pretty cute, huh?
-I wasn't staring.

116
00:07:29,281 --> 00:07:32,325
I didn't say you were.
I just said she was cute.

117
00:07:32,493 --> 00:07:33,952
Oh. Eh....

118
00:07:34,119 --> 00:07:38,414
Maybe. If you like women who are tall.

119
00:07:39,083 --> 00:07:41,210
And perfect.

120
00:07:43,253 --> 00:07:45,505
Sheldon,
why are you ignoring your sister?

121
00:07:45,673 --> 00:07:49,677
I'm not ignoring my sister.
I'm ignoring all of you.

122
00:07:49,843 --> 00:07:51,344
I brought snacks.

123
00:07:51,512 --> 00:07:55,015
Oh, my. Gherkins and....

124
