126
00:08:04,024 --> 00:08:07,277
Missy. Do you enjoy pajamas?

127
00:08:07,444 --> 00:08:10,655
-I guess.
-Yeah, we Indians invented them.

128
00:08:11,198 --> 00:08:13,033
You're welcome.

129
00:08:14,034 --> 00:08:16,995
Yeah, well,
my people invented circumcision.

130
00:08:21,500 --> 00:08:23,001
You're welcome.

131
00:08:24,628 --> 00:08:27,255
Missy, I'm gonna go get my nails done.
Do you wanna come?

132
00:08:27,423 --> 00:08:29,716
God, yes. Thanks.

133
00:08:29,883 --> 00:08:31,718
You're welcome.

134
00:08:32,469 --> 00:08:33,887
-Bye,guys.
-Bye, Missy.

135
00:08:34,054 --> 00:08:35,221
Bye, Missy, see you.

136
00:08:35,389 --> 00:08:38,600
-Goodbye, Leonard.
-Yeah, no, bye, Penny.

137
00:08:40,144 --> 00:08:43,105
-You two have to back off.
-Why should I back off? You back off.

138
00:08:43,272 --> 00:08:46,441
Excuse me, this is my apartment,
and she's my roommate's sister.

139
00:08:46,608 --> 00:08:49,068
